    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "0627077\nINTERIOR\nUNITED STATES\nDEPARTMENT OF THE INTERIOR\nFISH AND WILDLIFE SERVICE\nBUREAU OF SPORT FISHERIES AND WILDLIFE\nPEACHTREE-SEVENTH BUILDING\nATLANTA. GEORGIA 30323\nJanuary 29, 1965\nMr. Harold Bixby\nCaptiva\nFlorida\nDear Harold:\nI surely appreciate your telephone call this morning, and in spite\nof extremely tight travel ceilings, I think it best I do the following:\nAttend the meeting in Tallahassee, Tuesday, February 2, and also,\nand more important, attend the meeting at Sanibel on the 19th. I\nmay be presumptuous in saying I will attend the meeting on the 19th;\nwhat I mean is I will be available for any discussion concerning our\nBureau.\nI certainly look forward to seeing you and other interested\nparties\nin the Ding Darling memorial program.\nSincerely yours,\nGeech\nWalter A. Gresh\nRegional Director\nCC:\nMr. and Mrs. Richard Koss"
    ],
